    "headline": "Index of Names and Places",
    "text": "Alphabetical index of personal names, mythological figures, peoples, and places cited in the Milanese astrological codices, from Abel and Adam through Nemrod. Entries include folio and page references for authorities and terms such as the Anemoi, Fortuna, Lucifer, and the planets."
